<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 6.64 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 6.64 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 6.64 percent on Monday from 8.18 percent on Sunday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said four banks traded on the market in seven reported transactions with a total value of 9.25 million dinars ($13 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
